    <title>v0.1.0 — Initial Release</title>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/shruggietech/shruggie-feedtools/releases/tag/v0.1.0" />
    <updated>2026-02-10T16:00:00Z</updated>
    <author>
      <name>wthompson</name>
    </author>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;First public release of shruggie-feedtools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parse RSS 2.0, Atom 1.0, RSS 1.0, JSON Feed, and WordPress REST&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Normalize output to a single JSON schema&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CLI and GUI executables for Windows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
